  "sourceRulesPath": "sources/editorial/lost-object-recovery/directions/source-rules.json",
  "entries": [
    {
      "movingLine": 1,
      "changedTrigram": "离",
      "text": "传统方向偏南，场所参明窗、文书旁。起查可守住最后确认用过的一处文件台，若确有夹放或临时收拾，先请原处核清。",
      "sourceRule": "离",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:24:12.870Z",
      "textSha256": "b5290a1c1b537f84deb2d9347cf80a6663b7c1609ceeb6886ded6a6ab9b260a3"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 2,
      "changedTrigram": "巽",
      "text": "东南与木器之内是变巽的场所线索。若查询中有人只能转述，可请真正接触过原木柜或木箱的人补看，让收放经过接到实物。",
      "sourceRule": "巽",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:24:12.871Z",
      "textSha256": "c683f5aaf3933ce5fca089dc73ea40cc786feed62a5f74f4abc2fbd20393f951"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 3,
      "changedTrigram": "坤",
      "text": "方位取象在西南，仓储、方器属于坤象。若前后经手接不上，可先核实际用过的储物格，问清同批东西如何收起再查原件。",
      "sourceRule": "坤",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:24:12.871Z",
      "textSha256": "2c642ea695cc61c7048aa0592a5ead5d990c6ce405f5caef882293fd98821ea6"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 4,
      "changedTrigram": "离",
      "text": "南方是传统方向，离列明窗、文书旁。可先检查自己确知用过的文件收存处，原处若能协查，把哪些已看、哪些未看说明白。",
      "sourceRule": "离",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:24:12.871Z",
      "textSha256": "035f0f3b9973d478cc5a772b10f2c1862cb53d7303b89de657a22aa03e12215a"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 5,
      "changedTrigram": "巽",
      "text": "取象参东南，木器之内可作补查位置。若确有原来用过的木柜，可把收放次序与独有记号说准确，请能查看的人补核内部。",
      "sourceRule": "巽",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:24:12.871Z",
      "textSha256": "81be308ecfbe552c166b2df7980be3b1c8a6c920fc931060199d36cb543701f1"
    },
    {
      "movingLine": 6,
      "changedTrigram": "坤",
      "text": "西南与仓储、方器之中是变坤提示。已有证据能接到原收纳时，可认真核清实际用过的盒格，把物件认准以后再结束查验。",
      "sourceRule": "坤",
      "status": "AUTHOR_READ",
      "actor": "assistant-author",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-11-18T16:24:12.871Z",
      "textSha256": "614d861e25bcf6d8d7196a340f6c6f388e097f537e167d790641807d0be06515"
    }
  ]
}
